      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Z%C3%BCrichberg"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Around 57 BC the Romans founded the Turicum customs station on the hill, where travelers and goods were dispatched before entering Raetia.",
